                "control-id": "hipaa-164.312-e-1",
                "description": "The uploads, evidence, config, and state buckets each carry a policy denying any request where aws:SecureTransport is false, covering the bucket and its objects (GAP-03). Enforced by policies/hipaa_312e1_s3_tls_only.rego.",
