              {
                "uuid": "854948b7-9cbe-4098-a48e-f4f583aeabc2",
                "control-id": "hipaa-164.312-a-1",
                "description": "The intake Lambda's role is limited to dynamodb:PutItem, s3:PutObject on the uploads prefix, the two KMS actions it needs, and X-Ray tracing, in place of the starter's dynamodb:* and s3:* (GAP-07). Enforced by policies/hipaa_312a1_iam_least_privilege.rego, which denies any identity policy allowing * or a service-wide wildcard.",
