                "control-id": "hipaa-164.312-b",
                "description": "A multi-region CloudTrail with log-file validation records account activity, encrypted with a dedicated KMS key and delivered to a bucket with its own TLS-deny policy. AWS Config runs six managed rules against the S3, DynamoDB, Lambda, and API Gateway resources this component uses, and EventBridge routes NON_COMPLIANT findings to an encrypted SNS topic.",
